// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Safe rule evaluator.
//
// NOTE: docs/RULES_ENGINE.md proposes using `Function('ctx','req', ...)` to
// evaluate caller-supplied rule strings. That is dynamic eval of untrusted
